        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>开放式理解性默写练习（二）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 707px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 40px 45px 30px 40px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  /* hand-drawn like border frame */\n  .frame {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 18px;\n    top: 8px;\n    right: 18px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #2b2b2b;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .frame:before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -6px;\n    top: -6px;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 0;\n    border-top: 1.5px solid #2b2b2b;\n    transform: rotate(35deg);\n    transform-origin: left top;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .ans {\n    color: #e8342a;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n  }\n  .blank {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;\n    min-width: 130px;\n    height: 1em;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n  }\n  .blank.short {\n    min-width: 95px;\n  }\n  .blank.mid {\n    min-width: 110px;\n  }\n  .gap {\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #f4b6c0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 12px 0 4px 0;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"楷体\", serif;\n  }\n  .wm-inner {\n    display: inline-block;\n    color: #6a6a6a;\n    opacity: 0.75;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"frame\"></div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <p>8. 樽”指酒杯，也写成“尊”，在古代诗文中多指代饮酒，并以此表达作者饮酒时的心情，比如“<span class=\"blank\"></span>”或“<span class=\"blank\"></span>”。</p>\n    <p class=\"ans\">金樽清酒斗十千一尊还酹江月举匏樽以相属</p>\n\n    <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n    <p>9. 小明想从所学的诗文中选取两句话集成一副对联挂在书房，提醒自己学习、做事贵在坚持，可选择诗句“<span class=\"blank\"></span>，<span class=\"blank mid\"></span>”。</p>\n    <p class=\"ans\">锲而不舍，金石可镂；千淘万漉虽辛苦，吹尽狂沙始到金；宝剑锋从磨砺出，梅花香自苦寒来……</p>\n\n    <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n    <p>10.“沧海”经常出现在唐宋诗文中，和其他意象组合成一个意境，或展现宽阔胸襟，或寄托忧思情怀，或抒发离情别绪等，如“<span class=\"blank\"></span>，<span class=\"blank short\"></span>”。</p>\n    <p class=\"ans\">沧海月明珠有泪蓝田日暖玉生烟（或“寄蜉蝣于天地，渺沧海之一粟”“曾经沧海难为水，除却巫山不图片云”“东临碣石，以观沧海”）</p>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark\"><span class=\"wm-inner\">@灰杏读书</span></div>\n\n    <p>开放式理解性默写练习（二）</p>\n    <p>时量：15 分钟总分：20 分得分：</p>\n    <p>1. 龙是中国古代传说中的神异动物，是我国汉族的民族图腾，也是中国文化的突出符号。我国龙文化源远流长，“龙”在古诗文中也是俯拾即是，如“<span class=\"blank short\"></span>，<span class=\"blank short\"></span>”。</p>\n    <p class=\"ans\">还似旧时游上苑车如流水马如龙（但使龙城飞将在不教胡马度阴山/水不在深有龙则灵）</p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
